      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses renacidos se reunieron en Iðavöllr, la pradera verde donde antes se alzaba Asgard.",
          "en": "The reborn gods gathered on Idavoll, the green meadow where Asgard had once stood."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se sentaron en el pasto y hablaron del pasado: del Fimbulvetr, de la Serpiente de Midgard, del lobo y de las runas de Odín.",
          "en": "They sat in the grass and spoke of the old days: of Fimbulwinter, of the Midgard Serpent, of the wolf and of Odin's runes."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y mientras conversaban, uno vio un brillo entre las hojas de pasto.",
          "en": "And as they talked, one of them noticed a glint among the blades of grass."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eran las fichas de oro con que los dioses habían jugado al principio, cuando el mundo era joven.",
          "en": "They were the golden game pieces the gods had played with in the beginning, when the world was young."
        },
        {
          "es": "Habían atravesado el mar y el fuego intactas, esperando a que los dioses volvieran a jugar.",
          "en": "They had come through the sea and the fire unharmed, waiting for the gods to return and play again."
        }
      ],
