          "es": "Cuando el fuego se apagó, Líf y Lífþrasir salieron a la mañana, los primeros habitantes del mundo nuevo.",
          "en": "When the fire had died, Lif and Lifthrasir stepped out into the morning, the first people of the new world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Encontraron campos verdes, ríos limpios y un cielo sin una sola cicatriz.",
          "en": "They found green fields, clean rivers and a sky without a single scar."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tuvieron hijos, y sus hijos tuvieron hijos, y cada año eran más.",
          "en": "They had children, and their children had children, and every year there were more of them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pronto la tierra entera volvió a llenarse de gente, con casas, campos y fogatas en cada valle.",
          "en": "Soon the whole earth was full of people again, with houses, fields and hearth fires in every valley."
        }
      ],
